00:00:05,156 --> 00:00:08,580
So V is pi h cubed over twelve.

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:19,557
Differentiate with respect to time, put in three and h equals four: the level is rising at three over four pi, about a quarter of a metre a minute.

